\itemize{
\item \code{\link[DBI:dbSendQueryArrow]{DBI::dbSendQueryArrow()}} returns an \link{OdbcResultArrow} object.
\item \code{\link[DBI:dbFetchArrow]{DBI::dbFetchArrow()}}, \code{\link[DBI:dbGetQueryArrow]{DBI::dbGetQueryArrow()}}, and
\code{\link[DBI:dbReadTableArrow]{DBI::dbReadTableArrow()}} return a nanoarrow array stream (see
\code{\link[nanoarrow:as_nanoarrow_array_stream]{nanoarrow::as_nanoarrow_array_stream()}}), \code{\link[DBI:dbFetchArrowChunk]{DBI::dbFetchArrowChunk()}}
returns a nanoarrow array (see \code{\link[nanoarrow:as_nanoarrow_array]{nanoarrow::as_nanoarrow_array()}}).
Convert them with \code{\link[=as.data.frame]{as.data.frame()}},
\code{\link[nanoarrow:convert_array_stream]{nanoarrow::convert_array_stream()}}, or \code{arrow::as_arrow_table()}.
\item \code{\link[DBI:dbBindArrow]{DBI::dbBindArrow()}}, \code{\link[DBI:dbAppendTableArrow]{DBI::dbAppendTableArrow()}},
\code{\link[DBI:dbWriteTableArrow]{DBI::dbWriteTableArrow()}}, and \code{\link[DBI:dbCreateTableArrow]{DBI::dbCreateTableArrow()}} accept
anything that \code{\link[nanoarrow:as_nanoarrow_array_stream]{nanoarrow::as_nanoarrow_array_stream()}} can convert, for
example a data frame, a nanoarrow array or array stream, or an Arrow
